<h1>Reset your password</h1>

<p>
  Someone requested a password reset for your RePlay account.
  Click the button below to choose a new password.
</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>" class="btn">Reset Password</a>
</p>

<p class="text-faint">
  This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.
  If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.
</p>
